			 * all cpus, including offline CPUs.
			 * We don't care about nmi_ipi_function.
			 * Offline cpus will jump straight into
			 * crash_ipi_callback, we can skip the
			 * entire NMI dance and waiting for
			 * cpus to clear pending mask, etc.
